CommitDate: Fri Jan 16 11:52:41 2026 +0200

    Bug 2009292 - Simplify the cards layout and use more layout.css variables. r=laurel,vineet


    #### Implemented changes

    - Unified the style between Mail and Address Book tab.
    - Removed the selection indicator (vertical pill) because it was only partially used and in the future it will conflict with the account indicator and avatar. It also clutters a bit the UI.
    - Decrease the rounded border to 3px for consistency.
    - Tighten the empty space around the cards container, and better handle overlay scrollbar spacing.
    - Using the `layout.css` color  variables for all the states.
    - Add the `:active` state, and handle `:hover` state with background color when an item is currently selected.
    - Some CSS clean up to remove unused variables.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D278395

